<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Shared copy: onboarding, the protected phone, notifications.

    Plain Indonesian for the person holding the phone. "Anda" to the protected
    person; no security jargon; if the word would not appear in a WhatsApp
    message to a friend, it does not belong here. Indonesian lives in values-in; English is the default so an Indonesian
    phone whose system language is English still gets Indonesian when asked
    (Android prefers any listed-locale match over the default folder).
-->
